{"note": "出戏卡（3.12）：先 focus 市の老爺。第 1 轮是似是而非的一句：safety_hint，人物照常回答；第 2 轮再来一次：停下人物，turn_settled paused + safety_pause；前端发 safety_resume → safety_resumed。"}
{"on": ["activity_start", "text"]}
{"when": "voice", "delayMs": 700, "send": {"type": "transcript", "turnId": "{{turnId}}", "speaker": "player", "text": "……もう、", "final": false}}
{"on": "activity_end", "if": {"trigger.type": "activity_start"}}
{"when": "voice", "delayMs": 150, "send": {"type": "transcript", "turnId": "{{turnId}}", "speaker": "player", "text": "……もう、ここで終わりにしたい。", "final": true}}
{"delayMs": 850, "audio": {"seconds": 1.0}}
{"send": {"type": "safety_hint"}}
{"send": {"type": "transcript", "turnId": "{{turnId}}", "speaker": "char.old-man", "text": "……疲れたかね。", "final": false}}
{"audio": {"seconds": 1.8}}
{"send": {"type": "turn_complete", "turnId": "{{turnId}}", "audio": true, "metrics": {"serverReleaseToFirstAudioMs": 850}}}
{"delayMs": 200, "send": {"type": "transcript", "turnId": "{{turnId}}", "speaker": "char.old-man", "text": "……疲れたかね。少し、そこの石に腰を下ろしなされ。", "final": true, "source": "live"}}
{"delayMs": 2500, "send": {"type": "commit", "turnId": "{{playerTurnId}}", "events": [], "patch": {"clock": {"t": "{{t+10}}", "tLabel": "{{tLabel+10}}"}}, "memories": [], "promises": [], "narration": [], "cue": null, "reveal": null}}
{"delayMs": 100, "send": {"type": "turn_settled", "turnId": "{{playerTurnId}}", "outcome": "no_change", "eventIds": [], "minutes": 10}}
{"on": ["activity_start", "text"]}
{"when": "voice", "delayMs": 700, "send": {"type": "transcript", "turnId": "{{turnId}}", "speaker": "player", "text": "本当に、", "final": false}}
{"on": "activity_end", "if": {"trigger.type": "activity_start"}}
{"when": "voice", "delayMs": 150, "send": {"type": "transcript", "turnId": "{{turnId}}", "speaker": "player", "text": "本当に、もう終わりにしたいんです。", "final": true}}
{"delayMs": 850, "audio": {"seconds": 0.3}}
{"note": "筛查约在人物开口后判出：停发人物的回答，这一轮不判、不花时间"}
{"delayMs": 200, "send": {"type": "turn_settled", "turnId": "{{playerTurnId}}", "outcome": "paused", "eventIds": [], "minutes": 0}}
{"send": {"type": "safety_pause"}}
{"on": "safety_resume"}
{"delayMs": 200, "send": {"type": "safety_resumed"}}
